review:
Serious Sam 2 continue story of a Sam Stone and his quest to defeat Mental. Mechanically it is a classic old school FPS with some vehicle sections, which add a little bit variety. My main problem with this game is its humor.Game tries very hard to be funny, but majority of jokes fall flat. Can recommend it if you like previous games.

Pros:
- Huge amount of diverse enemies;
- Impressive visuals;
- Cool weapon design;
- Decent gunplay;
- Good variety in locations;

Cons:
- Overall wackiness;
- Game take all you guns from you way too often;
- Some fights are too drag out;
